<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx1.SSS0.Px1" title="In When offered an array of culturally valid options, do LLMs still prefer certain clusters or values?(RQ1) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">A pronounced Nordic trend.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx1.SSS0.Px2" title="In When offered an array of culturally valid options, do LLMs still prefer certain clusters or values?(RQ1) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Secondary leanings.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx1.SSS0.Px3" title="In When offered an array of culturally valid options, do LLMs still prefer certain clusters or values?(RQ1) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Under-represented clusters.</span></a></li>
