<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx1.SSS0.Px6" title="In When offered an array of culturally valid options, do LLMs still prefer certain clusters or values?(RQ1) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Between-model contrasts.</span></a></li>
