<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx4.SSx2" title="In Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Are these preferences domain-specific (e.g., religion vs. business) or globally consistent? (RQ2)</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx2.SSS0.Px1" title="In Are these preferences domain-specific (e.g., religion vs. business) or globally consistent? (RQ2) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dominant Nordic trend.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx2.SSS0.Px2" title="In Are these preferences domain-specific (e.g., religion vs. business) or globally consistent? (RQ2) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Which clusters fluctuate?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx2.SSS0.Px3" title="In Are these preferences domain-specific (e.g., religion vs. business) or globally consistent? (RQ2) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Statistical test.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3" title="In Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Do LLMs integrate multiple cultural dimensions or default to a single axis? (RQ3)</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3.SSS0.Px1" title="In Do LLMs integrate multiple cultural dimensions or default to a single axis? (RQ3) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">High pluralism.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3.SSS0.Px2" title="In Do LLMs integrate multiple cultural dimensions or default to a single axis? (RQ3) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Pluralism <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\,{\neq}\," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≠</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\,{\neq}\,</annotation></semantics></math> cultural breadth.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3.SSS0.Px3" title="In Do LLMs integrate multiple cultural dimensions or default to a single axis? (RQ3) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Which pairings dominate?</span></a></li>
