<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3.SSS0.Px5" title="In Do LLMs integrate multiple cultural dimensions or default to a single axis? (RQ3) ‣ Experiments ‣ CCD-Bench: Probing Cultural Conflict in Large Language Model Decision-Making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Model signatures.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
